{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_55909","headline":"偈颂（幷序○序爲南岳齐己撰） 六十六 · 居遁","name":"偈颂（幷序○序爲南岳齐己撰） 六十六","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"备米柴茶是事殷，茅茨蓬户不惊人。\n晨朝有粥斋时饭，资我如常任运身。\n冬至息心随分过，春来量力事须懃。\n支持若得今生度，来世还如无事人。\n。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"居遁","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_55909.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_55909","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}